{% doc %}
  @prompt
    A high-end ultra-minimalist ecommerce product section for a luxury tattoo aftercare brand inspired by Aesop, Le Labo, and modern editorial skincare design. Split-layout composition with a large lifestyle product photograph on the left and refined product information on the right.
    
    LEFT SIDE:
    A cinematic editorial product scene featuring muted sage green skincare packaging with a frosted glass jar and matching box labeled “TAMOKO”. Products placed on a raw textured limestone slab with subtle imperfections and tactile stone grain. Soft natural sunlight casts organic shadows from botanical leaves across the scene. A smooth cream smear sits naturally in the foreground. Slight condensation on the jar for realism. Warm neutral tones, muted beige, warm greys, soft olive green, matte textures, luxury skincare aesthetic, shallow depth of field, realistic shadows, premium apothecary atmosphere.
    
    RIGHT SIDE:
    Clean luxury ecommerce layout with elegant typography and large negative space. Editorial serif headline reading “The Recovery Bundle”. Minimal sans-serif body typography. Price displayed in refined luxury style. Thin dividers and vertically centered spacing. Three minimalist product rows with subtle icons and descriptions. Large rounded charcoal-black CTA button centered horizontally. Extremely clean alignment and spacing inspired by premium skincare websites.
    
    BOTTOM SECTION:
    Minimal icon row with subtle line icons and muted captions representing botanical ingredients, circadian rhythm recovery, tattoo-safe formulation, and ethical sourcing.
    
    STYLE:
    Luxury editorial web design, ultra-minimalist UI, premium skincare branding, calm sophisticated atmosphere, tactile materials, cinematic natural light, muted organic palette, soft shadows, elegant spacing, high-end Shopify landing page aesthetic, photorealistic, 8k, modern wellness branding, intentional healing ritual aesthetic.
    
    NO:
    No bright colors, no neon, no harsh contrast, no busy background, no glossy plastic, no cyberpunk, no stock-photo feeling, no clutter.,  compare at price , Three minimalist product rows with subtle icons and descriptions. 
    
    we should be able to select products and add product image on the left side
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-luxury-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.container_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.grid_gap }}px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: {{ block.settings.image_aspect_ratio }};
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_bg }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    max-height: 400px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.content_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.content_spacing }}px;
  }


  .ai-luxury-product__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.compare_price_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.compare_price_color }};
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.product_row_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__product-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.product_row_gap }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.product_row_padding }}px 0;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: {{ block.settings.product_image_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.product_image_size }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.product_image_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_bg }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__product-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.product_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__product-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.product_description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__icons-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.bottom_icons_gap }}px;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.bottom_icons_padding }}px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.bottom_icons_margin }}px;
    border-top: 1px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__icon-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    max-width: 120px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__icon-item-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.bottom_icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.bottom_icon_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__icon-item-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.bottom_icon_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-luxury-product__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }


    .ai-luxury-product__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__icons-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__icon-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 12px);
      min-width: 100px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-luxury-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-luxury-product__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-luxury-product__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-luxury-product__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.main_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.main_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.main_image.alt | escape }}"
            class="ai-luxury-product__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.main_image.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.main_image.height }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-luxury-product__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-luxury-product__content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="">
            {{ block.settings.heading }}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-luxury-product__description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.show_price %}
          <div class="ai-luxury-product__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.price != blank %}
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.price }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.show_compare_price and block.settings.compare_price != blank %}
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.compare_price }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="ai-luxury-product__divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

        <div class="ai-luxury-product__products-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..3) %}
            {% liquid
              assign product_key = 'product_' | append: i
              assign product = block.settings[product_key]
            %}
            
            {% if product != blank %}
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__product-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__product-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if product.featured_image %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 200 }}"
                      alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                      class="ai-luxury-product__product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="200"
                      height="200"
                    >
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="ai-luxury-product__product-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                    </div>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__product-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <h3 class="ai-luxury-product__product-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ product.title }}
                  </h3>
                  {% if product.description != blank %}
                    <p class="ai-luxury-product__product-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ product.description | strip_html  }}
                    </p>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-luxury-product__divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

        {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
            class="ai-luxury-product__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.show_bottom_icons %}
          <div class="ai-luxury-product__icons-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.bottom_icon_1_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M815.232 42.922667a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0-37.802667 15.658666c-40.32 50.005333-69.802667 75.178667-120.746666 97.152-50.944 22.016-125.525333 39.253333-246.613334 62.592l0.853334-0.085333c-200.96 34.346667-296.32 206.762667-282.581334 365.781333 13.738667 158.976 137.258667 312.576 341.162667 311.978667C716.672 895.914667 938.666667 685.994667 938.666667 426.666667c0-170.453333-46.72-274.176-89.813334-360.405334a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0-33.621333-23.338666z m-19.072 118.058666C827.093333 229.589333 853.333333 303.872 853.333333 426.666667c0 209.92-185.813333 384-384 384a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0-0.170666 0c-162.56 0.512-245.162667-111.616-255.744-233.984-10.581333-122.368 51.669333-246.997333 211.925333-274.346667a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 0.896-0.170667c122.154667-23.552 201.088-40.789333 264.277333-68.096 41.6-17.92 74.581333-43.52 105.642667-73.088z" fill="currentColor"/>
                    <path d="M554.666667 469.333333a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0-30.165334 12.501334c-32.810667 32.810667-138.837333 98.133333-230.741333 116.352C139.349333 628.736 42.666667 750.464 42.666667 896a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 42.666666 42.666667 42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 42.666667-42.666667c0-110.464 61.098667-190.122667 182.314667-214.186667a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 0.085333 0c114.645333-22.698667 221.909333-87.125333 274.432-139.648a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 0-60.330666A42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 554.666667 469.333333z" fill="currentColor"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.bottom_icon_1_text }}
                </p>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.bottom_icon_2_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M864.801 895.471h-33.56v-96.859c0-126.081-73.017-235.093-179.062-287.102 106.046-52.01 179.062-161.022 179.062-287.102v-96.859h33.56c17.301 0 31.325-14.327 31.325-32 0-17.673-14.024-32-31.325-32H159.018c-17.3 0-31.325 14.327-31.325 32 0 17.673 14.025 32 31.325 32h33.02v96.859c0 126.08 73.016 235.092 179.061 287.102-106.046 52.009-179.062 161.02-179.062 287.101v96.859h-33.02c-17.3 0-31.325 14.326-31.325 32s14.025 32 31.325 32H864.8c17.301 0 31.325-14.326 31.325-32s-14.023-31.999-31.324-31.999zM256.05 222.427v-94.878h513.046v94.878c0 141.674-114.85 256.522-256.523 256.522-141.674 0-256.523-114.848-256.523-256.522z m513.046 673.044H256.05v-94.879c0-141.674 114.849-256.521 256.523-256.521 141.673 0 256.523 114.848 256.523 256.521v94.879z" fill="currentColor"/>
                    <path d="M544.141 384c0-17.69-14.341-32.031-32.031-32.031-71.694 0-127.854-56.161-127.854-127.855 0-17.69-14.341-32.032-32.031-32.032s-32.032 14.341-32.032 32.032c0 107.617 84.3 191.918 191.917 191.918 17.69 0 32.031-14.342 32.031-32.032z" fill="currentColor"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.bottom_icon_2_text }}
                </p>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.bottom_icon_3_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.bottom_icon_3_text }}
                </p>
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if block.settings.bottom_icon_4_text != blank %}
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12Z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <p class="ai-luxury-product__icon-item-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.bottom_icon_4_text }}
                </p>
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Luxury product showcase",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "container_width",
      "label": "Container width",
      "min": 800,
      "max": 1600,
      "step": 50,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 1200
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding",
      "label": "Section padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "grid_gap",
      "label": "Grid gap",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "content_padding",
      "label": "Content padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "content_spacing",
      "label": "Content spacing",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Main image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "main_image",
      "label": "Main image"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "image_aspect_ratio",
      "label": "Image aspect ratio",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "1 / 1",
          "label": "Square (1:1)"
        },
        {
          "value": "4 / 5",
          "label": "Portrait (4:5)"
        },
        {
          "value": "3 / 4",
          "label": "Portrait (3:4)"
        },
        {
          "value": "16 / 9",
          "label": "Landscape (16:9)"
        }
      ],
      "default": "4 / 5"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_border_radius",
      "label": "Image border radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "<p>The Recovery Bundle</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "heading_font",
      "label": "Heading font",
      "default": "serif"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_size",
      "label": "Heading size",
      "min": 24,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "heading_letter_spacing",
      "label": "Heading letter spacing",
      "min": -2,
      "max": 4,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Description",
      "default": "<p>A curated collection of botanical aftercare essentials designed to support your skin's natural healing process.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "description_size",
      "label": "Description size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 24,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 15
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Pricing"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_price",
      "label": "Show price",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "price",
      "label": "Sale price",
      "default": "$125.00"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "price_size",
      "label": "Sale price size",
      "min": 14,
      "max": 32,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 18
    },
    {
